./CHANGELOG.md:121:* add --allow-private-webhooks flag to bypass SSRF protection ([#5694](https://github.com/usememos/memos/issues/5694)) ([cd5816c](https://github.com/usememos/memos/commit/cd5816c428931f56561f7d48b649a33858812539))
